= Breitscheid's Idea

Listen, man. I don't know what's going on here, and I don't like it one bit. I'm really not super jazzed about this whole decay thing. It's kind of freaking me out to be honest. This Ubik thing kind of spooks me too. It feels like the rest of the world is dead all of a sudden and we're the only ones left, and now we're crumbling bit by bit too.

I'll get to the point.

I have this Scythian friend in the, well what's left of the Foreign Ministry, who's offering to run us a woeful errand if we can just lend her a hand. 

Yeah, I know what you're thinking. But trust me, okay? 

- @seize_foreign_ministry: Seize the Foreign Ministry by force.

@seize_foreign_ministry
subtitle: [? if not we_are_awesome : Those sick futuristic firearms would really come in handy. ?][? if we_are_awesome : Sure is good we picked those sick futuristic firearms up. ?]
